 "creation-date": "2012-10-12",
 "description": "Although Interface and Interaction design typically pertain to the disciplinary domain of HCI, which can be considered a neighboring discipline to the semantic web, with this proposal we aim to bring the relevant aspects of HCI to address core technological, socio-technical and fundamental challenges for Semantic Web  (and Web Science) research. Read more: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1z-WtxO67ndfgLVmnZAld-7XA5P-CAg7XgMDZ4mbXgqs/edit",
